eed which was a new lap record.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":4,"text":"Varzi laps in 3m40.4s and passes Borzacchini for third.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":4,"text":"Materassi stops for less than a minute to adjust the steering and change the front wheels, dropping to ninth.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":5,"text":"Near the end of the fifth lap Williams slowed with a smoking engine that sounded really sick.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":5,"text":"Williams retires with broken piston rings; Nuvolari leads from Varzi, Brilli Peri and Borzacchini.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":7,"text":"On lap seven Brilli Peri drew level with Nuvolari on the straight and moved into the lead with Varzi following him and also passing Nuvolari.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":11,"text":"Arcangeli laps in 3m37.2s on lap 11.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":12,"text":"Brilli Peri pits for nearly three minutes, dropping from first to ninth; Nuvolari leads again from Chiron.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":13,"text":"With a lap of 3m38.6s Varzi passed Chiron on lap 13.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":15,"text":"Varzi and Chiron pass Nuvolari; Arcangeli closes to within three seconds of Nuvolari.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":15,"text":"Aymini retired at the beginning of lap 15 with an overheating engine while Tonini ended his race at the end of the same lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":18},{"lap":16,"text":"Chiron was in second place followed by Arcangeli who passed Nuvolari for third position","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":18,"text":"Materassi's Talbot leaves the track at the start of lap 18 while overtaking Foresti and plunges into the spectators beyond the ditch.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":18,"text":"The officials decide to let the race continue.","q":false},{"lap":20,"text":"On the 20th lap Chiron passed Varzi to take the lead","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":26,"text":"Borzacchini, fourth, hits the parked Bugatti of Blacque-B\u00e9lair on the inside straight and crashes out uninjured.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":29,"text":"Nuvolari pits for over six minutes and drops a lap down.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":30,"text":"Chiron and Varzi refuel in 1m40s and 1m45s; Campari takes over Varzi's Alfa Romeo.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Varzi hands the car over to Campari.","c":1},{"lap":30,"text":"Maggi hands the car over to Pastore.","c":4},{"lap":32,"text":"Nuvolari's car was not strong enough to fight off the storming Drouet and he lost his third place when he was passed on lap 32.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":37,"text":"Campari hands the Alfa Romeo back to Varzi; the change takes 50 seconds.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":37,"text":"Pastore hands the car over to Borzacchini.","c":4},{"lap":42,"text":"On lap 42 Drouet stopped for three minutes to fix a leaking pipe enabling Nuvolari to take back third position","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":46,"text":"On lap 46, Chiron and Varzi maintained their leading positions but with an increased gap of 1m08.6s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"At the end of 60 laps Chiron crossed the finish line after 3h45m08.6 s with an increased average speed of 159.898 km/h, a new record for Monza","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"Varzi followed 2m20.4s behind in second place and was the only car on the same lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1}]}